From 89a587d6ecea9710a55a336b9f269f1ac985b2cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Frank Gehann <fg@fgehann.de>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 10:19:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] dnf5: Report what happens before installing

Between downloading and installing, libdnf5 checks the package
signatures and runs an rpm test transaction without calling any
transaction callback, so nothing at all was reported for several
seconds. Report this as test-commit with an unknown percentage, and
report the signature verification and the preparation of the rpm
transaction from their callbacks as sig-check and commit.

Fixes: https://github.com/PackageKit/PackageKit/issues/1019
