Subject: [PATCH 4/8] dnf5: Report scriptlets and reloading after install

Once rpm has processed every package, it still runs the %posttrans
scriptlets and file triggers, and the backend then reloads the
repositories. This took around 5 seconds in which nothing at all was
reported, with the percentage stuck at 100.

Report the scriptlets that run after the last package as run-hook, and
the reloading as loading-cache, both with an unknown percentage.

Related: https://github.com/PackageKit/PackageKit/issues/1019
